:'''Cocolia:''' Something created using otherworldly technology... An inhibitor that a corporation from the Old World and the Architects attempted to use to house the Stellaron.
:'''Cocolia:''' ...I know you have many questions, my daughter. Be patient... soon you will have all the answers.
